        a                      owl:Ontology ;
        rdfs:comment           "Curated with GO AI HUB. ATG2A transfers phosphatidylserine from the ER (supplied by the TMEM41B scramblase) to the phagophore, where ATG9A scrambles it; the TOM70-TOM40 (TOM complex) recruits ATG2A to the MAM, in autophagosome assembly." ;
